  "about": {
    "eyebrow": "About Me",
    "headline": "Beauty that remains natural",
    "intro": "Welcome! I am Anna Kohut, specializing in permanent make-up and aesthetic cosmetology with 7 years of experience.",
    "story": "My path into the beauty industry didn't start from the very beginning. Originally, I worked in banking, and permanent make-up was initially my passion and hobby. Over time, I realized how much this work fulfills and inspires me. What started as a hobby has become my profession – and today it is an important part of my life. Since 2022, I have been living and working in Germany. During this time, I have continuously developed my skills, attending numerous further training courses, seminars, and masterclasses to deepen my knowledge in the field of permanent make-up and cosmetology.",
    "philosophy": "For me, my work is above all about emphasizing your natural beauty – not changing it. I love natural, harmonious results that suit the individual facial features, personal style, and wishes of every woman. Every client is unique to me.",
    "quote": "And perhaps what I love most about my work is the moment when a woman looks in the mirror after treatment and smiles. When she doesn't see someone else, but herself – only a little more groomed, fresher, and more confident.",
    "badges": [
      "7 Years Experience",
      "International Diplomas",
      "Regular Training"
    ]
  },
